+  *                      Force_En  Force_Dis Auto
+  * BIT8   SP_SDS_FRC_AN          1        1        0
+  * BIT9   SP_SDS_FRC_AN_EN       1        0        x
+  *                          3        1        0
+  * 0: NWAY_AUTO
